  "discussions_data": [
    {
      "id": "df6b16e8951700d325af2e0efff194624c4d54fc",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 780815508,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Example with the mentioned pcap before applying the fix, using:\n`fprintf(stderr, \"crc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x%x, 0x%x 0x%x) => 0x%x (0x%x)\\n\", hdrcrc6, first_octet, second_octet, crccheck, crc6_0X6F(0, octet_array, 2));`\n\n```\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x37, 0xe0 0x0) => 0x28 (0x37)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x37, 0xe4 0x0) => 0x16 (0x9)  // EXPECTED TO BE WRONG (Initialization ACK)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x37, 0xe0 0x0) => 0x28 (0x37)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x37, 0xe4 0x0) => 0x16 (0x9)   // EXPECTED TO BE WRONG (Initialization ACK)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x38, 0x1 0x0) => 0xf (0x38)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x38, 0x1 0x0) => 0xf (0x38)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x1f, 0x2 0x0) => 0x1e (0x1f)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x1f, 0x2 0x0) => 0x1e (0x1f)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x3e, 0x4 0x0) => 0x3c (0x3e)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x3e, 0x4 0x0) => 0x3c (0x3e)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x6, 0x5 0x0) => 0x33 (0x6)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x6, 0x5 0x0) => 0x33 (0x6)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x21, 0x6 0x0) => 0x22 (0x21)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x21, 0x6 0x0) => 0x22 (0x21)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x19, 0x7 0x0) => 0x2d (0x19)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x19, 0x7 0x0) => 0x2d (0x19)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x13, 0x8 0x0) => 0x17 (0x13)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x13, 0x8 0x0) => 0x17 (0x13)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x2b, 0x9 0x0) => 0x18 (0x2b)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x2b, 0x9 0x0) => 0x18 (0x2b)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x23, 0xa 0x1) => 0x33 (0x23)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x23, 0xa 0x1) => 0x33 (0x23)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x3a, 0xd 0x1) => 0x1e (0x3a)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x3a, 0xd 0x1) => 0x1e (0x3a)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x38, 0x1 0x0) => 0xf (0x38)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x38, 0x1 0x0) => 0xf (0x38)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x1f, 0x2 0x0) => 0x1e (0x1f)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x1f, 0x2 0x0) => 0x1e (0x1f)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x27, 0x3 0x0) => 0x11 (0x27)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x27, 0x3 0x0) => 0x11 (0x27)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x3e, 0x4 0x0) => 0x3c (0x3e)\ncrc6_0X6F(hdrcrc6=0x3e, 0x4 0x0) => 0x3c (0x3e)\n```\n\n\nThe Intiialization ACK messages in the pcap file are expected to have wrong CRC due to the program generating them, which still has hacky IuUP support (I just fixed it here: https://gerrit.osmocom.org/c/osmo-mgw/+/26598)",
